  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are an about page and a fall office menu for Salvia Kitchen, a catering business run by Ana and her brother Tomas.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_e7767d8827ee"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_e7767d8827ee"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum, and family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice, and delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown or $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every menu can be made gluten-free, and all eight major allergens are labeled.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Salvia Kitchen served about 9,600 guests at 214 events last year, but its largest tray serves only 40. How does it handle bigger events?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_e7767d8827ee"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Baby showers are a main source of business, yet the fall menu is built only for offices. What does Salvia Kitchen offer shower clients?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_e7767d8827ee"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Produce comes from farms within 40 miles, but free delivery covers only 10 miles of downtown. How often do clients pay the $35 fee?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_e7767d8827ee"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_f4ecea40840a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
    "source_ids": [
